---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: "Get a Quote"
metaTitle: "Get a Free Quote | Stonemasons in Winchcombe & Cheltenham"
metaDescription: "Request a free, no-obligation quotation from Jackson's Stonemasonry — dry stone walling, restoration, cleaning, carving and wall repair across Gloucestershire and the Cotswolds."
permalink: "/quote/"
breadcrumbs:
  - { name: "Home", url: "/" }
---
<header class="page-hero">
  <div class="wrap">
    <p class="eyebrow">Free &middot; Written &middot; No Obligation</p>
    <h1>Request a Free Quotation</h1>
    <p class="lede">Tell us about the job and attach a few photos — for most work that's enough for a useful first answer. We'll come back to you promptly with honest advice and a written quote. Prefer to talk? Call <a href="tel:{{ site.phoneInternational }}">{{ site.phone }}</a>.</p>
  </div>
</header>

<section class="section">
  <div class="wrap">
    {#-
      Handled by Netlify Forms: data-netlify="true" registers the form when
      Netlify scans the deployed HTML. Detection runs AT DEPLOY TIME, so after
      enabling form detection the site must be redeployed before submissions
      work — until then the POST to /thank-you/ returns 404.
      Alert recipients are configured in the Netlify UI (Forms > Form
      notifications), not here. To move off Netlify, point action= at a
      Formspree/Basin endpoint instead.
    -#}
    <form class="quote-form" name="quote" method="POST" action="/thank-you/" data-netlify="true" data-netlify-honeypot="bot-field" enctype="multipart/form-data">
      <input type="hidden" name="form-name" value="quote">
      {#- Honeypot: hidden from people, filled in by bots, so Netlify can bin those. -#}
      <p class="visually-hidden" aria-hidden="true">
        <label>Leave this field empty: <input name="bot-field" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off"></label>
      </p>

      <fieldset>
        <legend>What do you need help with?</legend>
        <div class="choice-grid">
          <label class="choice"><input type="radio" name="service" value="Dry stone walling" required> Dry stone walling</label>
          <label class="choice"><input type="radio" name="service" value="Stone restoration"> Stone restoration</label>
          <label class="choice"><input type="radio" name="service" value="Repointing"> Repointing</label>
          <label class="choice"><input type="radio" name="service" value="Stone cleaning"> Stone cleaning</label>
          <label class="choice"><input type="radio" name="service" value="Stone wall repair"> Stone wall repair</label>
          <label class="choice"><input type="radio" name="service" value="New stonework"> New stonework</label>
          <label class="choice"><input type="radio" name="service" value="Stone fireplace"> Stone fireplace</label>
          <label class="choice"><input type="radio" name="service" value="Stone carving"> Stone carving</label>
          <label class="choice"><input type="radio" name="service" value="Not sure"> Not sure — advise me</label>
        </div>
      </fieldset>

      <fieldset>
        <legend>Where is the project?</legend>
        <div class="field">
          <label for="postcode">Postcode or town</label>
          <p class="hint">A postcode helps us judge travel and, for walls, the local stone.</p>
          <input type="text" id="postcode" name="postcode" autocomplete="postal-code" required>
        </div>
      </fieldset>

      <fieldset>
        <legend>Tell us about the project</legend>
        <div class="field">
          <label for="details">What needs doing?</label>
          <p class="hint">Rough size (e.g. "about 5 metres of wall has collapsed"), what happened, and any timescales.</p>
          <textarea id="details" name="details" rows="6" required></textarea>
        </div>
        <div class="field">
          <label for="photos">Upload photographs</label>
          <p class="hint">Photos are the single most useful thing you can send — a wide shot and a close-up is ideal.</p>
          <input type="file" id="photos" name="photos" accept="image/*" multiple>
        </div>
      </fieldset>

      <fieldset>
        <legend>Your contact details</legend>
        <div class="field-row">
          <div class="field">
            <label for="name">Name</label>
            <input type="text" id="name" name="name" autocomplete="name" required>
          </div>
          <div class="field">
            <label for="phone">Phone</label>
            <input type="tel" id="phone" name="phone" autocomplete="tel" required>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="field">
          <label for="email">Email</label>
          <input type="email" id="email" name="email" autocomplete="email" required>
        </div>
      </fieldset>

      <button class="btn btn--primary" type="submit">Request my free quotation</button>
      <p class="hint" style="margin-top:0.9rem">We'll only use your details to respond to this enquiry — no mailing lists, no passing anything on.</p>
    </form>
  </div>
</section>
